stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Disabled
  Disabled --> Watching: installation enabled, baseline current sources
  Watching --> Queued: new actionable source revision
  Watching --> Watching: historic source or duplicate notification
  Queued --> Resolved: source reviewed, deleted, snoozed or settled
  Queued --> Unavailable: another actor opens link
  Queued --> CardOpen: recipient opens exact current card
  CardOpen --> Resolved: domain review or feedback acknowledgement
  Resolved --> Queued: new feedback revision
  Queued --> Expired: 24 hours pass
